OL,3,GNEWSATheatre reopening date confirmed
OL,4,Aafter #10m refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Sussex theatre will reopen next
OL,7,Fmonth after a #10.2m refurbishment with
OL,8,Fcapacity increased to 420 seats and the
OL,9,Ffoyer refreshed.
OL,11,FIn 2024, the district council outlined
OL,12,Fplans to renovate the Capitol Theatre
OL,13,Fin Horsham which had last been
OL,14,Frefurbished 23 years ago.
OL,16,FThe works, which began in January after
OL,17,Fthe project was rescoped to reduce
OL,18,Fcosts, also included a makeover in the
OL,19,Fbar area and box office, as well as
OL,20,Fimproved toilet facilities.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
